#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:1 fa167f97b4f34fab9e691f988aef4276
msgid "Play with DingoDB using SQL"
msgstr "使用 SQL 连接 DingoDB"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:3 cf5d4f46e0334f97b42d39488b25999e
msgid "Play DingoDB with SQL Tools"
msgstr "使用 SQL 工具"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:5 ccaf6663c2584e08ac4a746fa6ccc9c9
msgid "Setup Connection to DingoDB"
msgstr "与 DingoDB 建立连接"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:7 c8dd3595b25d4407a890c2d857fdb95d
msgid "1.Launch DBeaver tool, navigate to menu Window -> Driver Manager"
msgstr "1.启动DBeaver工具，导航到菜单窗口->驱动管理器"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:9 9fb5f38fa39b4766939365c082967414
msgid "![Driver Manager](../../images/usage_dbeaver_driver_manager.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:9 fb5ee7737c51409c942c11f26f38c51a
msgid "Driver Manager"
msgstr "驱动管理器"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:11 1b5efef4f9cb452391e852aaad8da446
msgid "2.In the Driver Manager dialog, click on “New” button,create new driver"
msgstr "2.在驱动程序管理器对话框中，点击“新建”按钮，创建新的驱动程序"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:13 f1471249452147c284532f382de39a44
msgid ""
"3.In the New Driver dialog, provide the “Driver Name” and “Class Name”, here please input "
"the class name as “io.dingodb.driver.client.DingoDriverClient”"
msgstr ""
"3.在“新建驱动程序”对话框中提供“驱动程序名称”和“类名称”，这里请输入类名称"
"为“io.dingodb.driver.client.DingoDriverClient”。"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:15 0e6201b4bc0b408dae22813ca2f1aedf
msgid "![Import driver file](../../images/usage_dbeaver_import_driver_file.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:15 db7240a70f734d48a420d1b6d943251b
msgid "Import driver file"
msgstr "导入驱动文件"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:17 2dcd12054c754df2a93f5544daf93ba2
msgid "4.Then click on the “library” tab, and click “Add file” button."
msgstr "4.然后点击“库”选项卡，点击“添加文件”按钮。"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:19 e54772e004cf48069b6e8e8a2b4e9641
msgid ""
"5.Add the DingoDB driver “dingo-driver-client-all.jar”, click “Search” and select the "
"DingoDB driver “io.dingodb.driver.client.DingoDriverClient”."
msgstr ""
"5.添加DingoDB驱动程序“dingo-driver-client-all.jar”，点击“Search”，选择DingoDB驱动程"
"序“io.dingodb.driver.client.DingoDriverClient”。"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:21 f7691f5cfdc04815b5392bb724f27419
msgid "![Find class](../../images/usage_dbeaver_find_class.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:21 6b29f7a1e3a8468887578f628712674d
msgid "Find class"
msgstr "查找类名"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:23 e96f01d85c0240ff9e054f7d94583fc9
msgid "6.Click “OK”, then you will see the DingoDB driver shown in driver list."
msgstr "6.点击“OK”，将在驱动列表中显示DingoDB驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:25 45221fc3be534efbb18963bd821608b0
msgid ""
"7.Back to DBeaver main screen, click on “New Database Connection” from the toolbar, and "
"select “DingoDB” item."
msgstr "7.回到DBeaver主界面，点击工具栏中的“新建数据库连接”，选择“DingoDB”项。"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:27 7e7fc5255c034f96ba9eeb0f1d0813b8
msgid ""
"8.In New Database Connection dialog, provide valid JDBC URL, User and Password, then “Test "
"Connection” and see the Database connected successfully."
msgstr ""
"8.在“新建数据库连接”对话框中，提供有效的JDBC URL、用户和密码，然后单击“测试连接”，即可看到数"
"据库连接成功。"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:29 ee46a244cb2546848b8cc028f29e745e
msgid "![New databases](../../images/usage_dbeaver_new_databases.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:29 9c1f7288fbbe4a858660fc1e66ae31f9
msgid "New databases"
msgstr "新数据库"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:31 9e6309d55cd44955903eccd962bcfd63
msgid ""
"9.Click Finish and see the DingoDB connection displayed in Database Connections Navigator on "
"left."
msgstr "9.单击Finish，在左侧的数据库连接导航器中看到DingoDB连接。"

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:33 040b074f4b3044d4b8ca0b6c32110213
msgid "![Connection](../../images/usage_dbeaver_successful_connection.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_sql.md:33 a15d03bb8b534eb0a5e7f48fdad4e850
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "连接"

